BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 1: Governance) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (The sections below follow the order in which customers usually ask their questions.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (A written security policy covers all staff, and management approval is renewed at each) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (annual policy review.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (Security roles and responsibilities are documented, and a named security officer reports) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (to the executive team.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (A risk assessment is performed every year and after major changes, and findings are) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (tracked in a risk register with risk treatment plans.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (Regular company meetings give every employee a chance to raise questions with the) Tj ET
BT 59.53 556.13 Td (leadership.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 247.18 33.03 Td (Nimbara HR - Page 2 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

endstream
