BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 2: Access) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (Accounts for new staff are created on their first day at the company.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (Access to systems and customer data follows an access control policy based on least) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (privilege and role-based access.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (All workforce accounts use MFA through the company single sign-on provider, with strong) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (authentication on administrative interfaces.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (Privileged access is limited to a small group of approved staff, and administrator) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (accounts are separate, logged and reviewed.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (An access review takes place once a year, and deprovisioning is handled manually for) Tj ET
BT 59.53 556.13 Td (some systems.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 524.95 Td (The helpdesk answers questions about laptops and accounts during office hours.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 247.18 33.03 Td (Nimbara HR - Page 3 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

endstream
