BT /F1 14.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 773.20 Td (Section 4: Operations) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (New features are announced to customers in a monthly newsletter.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (Security-relevant events are sent to a central SIEM for logging, and audit logs are kept) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (for twelve months under our log retention rule.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (Vulnerability scanning runs weekly, and patching of critical vulnerabilities follows a) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (remediation SLA of 14 days.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (Security groups restrict traffic between environments, and a web application firewall) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (and intrusion detection protect public endpoints.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (Operational dashboards show how fast pages load for customers around the world.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
BT 247.18 33.03 Td (Nimbara HR - Page 5 of ) Tj (9) Tj ET

