BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (Engineers use modern programming languages and shared libraries.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (Software follows a secure development lifecycle in which every change gets a code review) Tj ET
BT 59.53 696.45 Td (and SAST runs in the pipeline.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 665.27 Td (A change advisory board approves releases, and peer-reviewed changes move through the) Tj ET
BT 59.53 649.68 Td (deployment pipeline.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 618.50 Td (The engineering group meets every Monday to discuss the week.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.00 Tf ET
